 \\\"ils/elles\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-aient\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Je devrais \u00e9crire \u00e0 mes amis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Nous pr\u00e9f\u00e9rerions aller au restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Voici ci-dessous un exemple avec le verbe <span class=\"strong\">devoir</span> :", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Futur\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Imparfait\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Conditionnel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je <span class=\\\"strong\\\">devr</span>ai <br/> tu <span class=\\\"strong\\\">devr</span>as <br/>  il/elle <span class=\\\"strong\\\">devr</span>a <br/> nous <span class=\\\"strong\\\">devr</span>ons <br/> vous <span class=\\\"strong\\\">devr</span>ez <br/> ils/elles <span class=\\\"strong\\\">devr</span>ont\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je dev<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ais</span> <br/> tu dev<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ais</span> <br/> il /elle/on dev<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ait</span> <br/> nous dev<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ions</span> <br/> vous dev<span class=\\\"strong\\\">iez</span> <br/> ils/elles dev<span class=\\\"strong\\\">aient</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je devrais <br/> tu devrais <br/> il/elle/on devrait <br/> nous devrions <br/> vous devriez <br/> ils/elles devraient\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Parlez \u00e0 trois amis.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Demandez-leur ce qu'ils veulent faire pour une occasion sp\u00e9ciale.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Sugg\u00e9rez un endroit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compl\u00e9tez le tableau ci-